<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ plans further deregulation of postal services.</title>
<headline>NZ plans further deregulation of postal services.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's Communications Ministry said on Tuesday it would formally announce the government's intention to deregulate postal services at a news conference later in the day.</p>
<p>Minister Maurice Williamson was scheduled to hold the news conference at 3.00 pm local time (0300 GMT), it said in a statement.</p>
